### =====================================================================
### Phase 4: months and the meal grid
### Click "Send Request" above each request, top to bottom.
### If you changed the manager password, update it in step 1.
### Member ids: the manager is usually 1 and Srijila 2. Step 3 shows the real ids.
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@srijilaId = 2


### 1. Log in as the manager
# @name managerLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "changeme123"
}

@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.token}}


### 2. Open October 2026 (the first month can be any month) → 201
POST {{base}}/months
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 10
}


### 3. Month details: who is in October? (check the member ids here)
GET {{base}}/months/2026/10
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 4. The meal grid: 31 days, all 0.00 so far
GET {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 5. Save several cells at once → "changedCells": 4
PUT {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "memberId": 1,             "date": "2026-10-01", "meals": 2 },
    { "memberId": 1,             "date": "2026-10-02", "meals": 1 },
    { "memberId": {{srijilaId}}, "date": "2026-10-01", "meals": 0.5 },
    { "memberId": {{srijilaId}}, "date": "2026-10-02", "meals": 0.25 }
  ]
}


### 6. Send the same values again → "changedCells": 0 (nothing changed, no audit row)
PUT {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "memberId": 1, "date": "2026-10-01", "meals": 2 }
  ]
}


### 7. Invalid meal value 0.3 → 400 (nothing saved)
PUT {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "memberId": 1, "date": "2026-10-03", "meals": 0.3 }
  ]
}


### 8. Date outside October → 400
PUT {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "memberId": 1, "date": "2026-11-01", "meals": 2 }
  ]
}


### 9. Live meal summary (no expenses yet, so the rate is 0 for now)
GET {{base}}/months/2026/10/meal-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 10. Skipping a month → 400 "The next month to open is November 2026"
POST {{base}}/months
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 12
}


### 11. All months
GET {{base}}/months
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### 12. Log in as Srijila
# @name memberLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "srijila",
  "password": "srijila-pass-123"
}

@memberToken = {{memberLogin.response.body.token}}


### 13. Srijila CAN view the grid → 200
GET {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}


### 14. Srijila CANNOT edit meals → 403
PUT {{base}}/months/2026/10/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entries": [
    { "memberId": {{srijilaId}}, "date": "2026-10-05", "meals": 0 }
  ]
}


### 15. Srijila CANNOT open months → 403
POST {{base}}/months
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 11
}
